// Ported/landed suites:
//   - test_phase2.py: TestWebsiteStateDB (processed round-trip, retry
//     counts + backoff with first_failed_at survival, due-retries cap +
//     time, resolve_retry, dismissed).
//   - test_onespelling.py: TestTheStateBoundary + TestTheHealingPass —
//     THE ONE SPELLING at the ledger's boundary and the v0.64.0 healing
//     pass's merge preferences. (TestTheDoorHeals + the pipeline classes
//     are Phase-4 T-40 territory — the door helper is pipeline code.)
//   - test_settledledger.py: TestTheLedger — settle_existing seeds every
//     table + clears the queue, idempotence, extras; the settle_urls
//     round-trip leg is adapted to SettleExisting extras because
//     settle_urls is DEAD CODE in the reference (no production callers;
//     the module spec's "Dead: settle_urls" note) and is not ported —
//     the unsettle honest-booleans half is preserved verbatim.
//   - test_queuehistory.py: TestTheSecondPass — settle_queue_history's
//     full contract (inserted-count honesty, one-spelling fold, settled
//     URLs' retries resolve, no bulk clear, broken/empty inputs).
//   - test_masterretry.py: TestResetRetryAttempts — the surgical reborn.
//   - The generated pure corpus (the _key boundary battery + the 2×
//     attempts backoff table + the rune truncation battery) —
//     TestPureGolden.
//   - THE T-23 ACCEPTANCE: opening the real Python-created
//     websitestate_python_created.db fixture passes read/write probes
//     with every table byte-exact vs the golden (task list T-23 row);
